flowchart LR
    U[User task on D1 / W1 / W2] --> X[End-to-end telemetry]
    X --> B[Performance and correctness budgets]
    B --> L[Load, capacity and saturation model]
    L --> C[Vendor + infrastructure + human unit cost]
    C --> D{Within UX, safety and business envelope?}
    D -- No --> O[Profile and optimize highest causal bottleneck]
    O --> X
    D -- Yes --> F[Forecast, release and monitor]
    F --> P[Pilot evidence replaces assumptions]
    P --> B

